<title>UK: Nat Express selected for N. London Rail bid.</title>
<headline>Nat Express selected for N. London Rail bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British passenger transport and airport operator National Express Group Ltd said on Monday it had been selected as the preferred bidder for North London Railways.</p>
<p>Last week, National Express was selected as the preferred bidder for Scottish bus company Taybus.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
